  "goodToKnow": "Das Kernkraftwerk (KKW) is a nuclear power plant; opponents prefer Atomkraftwerk (AKW). Germany's last three were shut down in April 2023, and their Rückbau (dismantling) will take decades. The search for an Endlager (permanent repository) for nuclear waste continues, after the Gorleben salt dome was ruled out in 2020. Plural: die Kernkraftwerke."
